
## 2. `.gitignore`

Crée/remplace `.gitignore` :

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.yarn/
.yarn-cache/

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
coverage/

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

# IDE
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Vite
.vite/

# Cache
.cache/
.tmp/
temp/

# Docker local
docker-compose.override.yml

# Local artifacts
*.local